            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Webshop_still_life_compressed.webp",
            "caption": "Discover our",
            "heading": "Beaded bracelets",
            "text": "<p>Celebrate the essence of Shamballa Jewels with our Beaded Bracelets. Each piece features intricately designed beads, including G/VS diamonds and vibrant gemstones, crafted to perfection for a unique and luxurious look. Perfect for both men and women, these high-end bracelets elevate any outfit.</p>",
