            "caption": "Discover our",
            "heading": "Orb bracelets",
            "text": "<p>Discover our Orb Bracelets, featuring customizable options that allow you to express your unique style. Choose from a variety of materials, including diamonds and 18K gold, to create a piece that is truly your own. These versatile bracelets are suitable for any occasion.</p>",
            "button_label": "Shop all orb bracelets",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/orb-bracelets"
          }
        },
