            "caption": "Discover our",
            "heading": "Solid bracelets",
            "text": "<p>Embrace timeless elegance with our Solid Bracelets. Crafted from premium materials and 18K gold, these designs offer a sleek and sophisticated look, perfect for both men and women. Ideal for those who appreciate minimalist luxury.</p>",
            "button_label": "shop all solid bracelets",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/solid-bracelets"
